      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Guiding catheter strategies form an important component of successful PTCA. Selection of appropriate guiding catheters is essential for providing adequate back-up support and visualization. Hockey stick guiding catheters are an excellent choice for performing PTCA of the right coronary artery and for saphenous vein grafts."},
